{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124043","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124043","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124043.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124043.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-01T15:58:29Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSaves ~430kb on macOS and ~230kb on web (25kb gzip, 0 brotli).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe `PropertyInfo` constructor and destructor, as well as the conversions, were copied thousands of times across `GDCLASS` instances which is what made this so big.\r\n\r\n`_get_property_list` is not performance sensitive so the additional call is negligible.\r\n\r\nFuture changes could shrink the size further by making this non-virtual, like `Object::is_class` via https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105793. But that requires https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123136 to be merged first. I might do that in 4.9.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/12